The function `add` has an external WebAssembly implementation in the module
`./ffi.cjs`, which is neither a JavaScript module, ending in `.mjs` or
`.js`, nor a module of the environment, with a plain name like `env`.

Hint: To use another JavaScript module, write a `.mjs` module that
re-exports it.
